# Google Maps API Key (JavaScript API)
# 1. Buka https://console.cloud.google.com/ -> pilih project -> enable "Maps JavaScript API"
# 2. Credentials > Create Credentials > API key
# 3. Application restrictions -> HTTP referrers -> localhost*
#    API restrictions         -> Maps JavaScript API
# 4. Salin key ke EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY lalu restart `npx expo start -c`
# 5. Verifikasi dengan: npm run check:maps
#
# JANGAN tertukar: key Google Maps (AIza...) hanya untuk EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your-google-maps-api-key-here
